4006 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 4007 0 R/Alt(Two plots. Left: 1500 particles of an isotropic Maxwellian at the midplane of a mirror with mirror ratio 4, plotted as perpendicular against parallel velocity in thermal speeds. Most are trapped dots; lost particles, marked by triangles, fill the two wedges around the parallel axis below dashed lines at the loss-cone angle, sine squared theta_c equal to one over R_m. Right: fraction of particles lost against the mirror ratio from 1 to 20; sample points lie on the curve one minus the square root of one minus one over R_m, falling from 1 to about 0.03.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 17739 0 R>>
endobj
