<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 8736 0 R/Alt(Momentum-transfer weight per logarithmic interval of impact parameter, in units of 4 pi b90 squared, versus b/b90 on a logarithmic axis from 0.01 to 1e8. The weight rises from zero below b90, is flat at one for every decade above b90, and is cut to zero at the Debye length, lambda_D/b90 = 4.2e6. The shaded area equals ln Lambda_cut, about 15.2.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[12]/Pg 17829 0 R>>
