9857 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 9858 0 R/Alt(Horizontal arrows show the x components of the electron and ion particle fluxes in the ambipolar worked example, in units of 1e17 per square metre per second. Electron diffusion alone gives about 17.6; the ambipolar field drift subtracts about 15.8. Ion diffusion gives about 1.0 and the field drift adds about 0.9. Both totals end on the common ambipolar flux 1.82, marked by a dotted vertical line.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[67]/Pg 17849 0 R>>
